[{"id":"1296174137291857920","date":1597866970000,"rawContent":"Every major disaster or pandemic that exacerbates every kind of inequality is a small precursor of climate-related disruption to come. #ClimateCrisis","media":null,"username":"LindseyBoylan","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":true,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":1.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":8,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":6,"sumOfClimate":27,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":1.0},{"id":"1296813278690254848","date":1598019353000,"rawContent":"There was not enough about climate change during the convention.  And the policies proposed do not go nearly far enough.  We will have to hold Biden\/Harris accountable once we elect them in November. #ClimateEmergency","media":null,"username":"LindseyBoylan","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":true,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":8,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":6,"sumOfClimate":28,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":2.0},{"id":"1299362354610798592","date":1598627100000,"rawContent":"We need our leaders at every level to take decisive action regarding the #ClimateCrisis because our communities are already feelings the effects of their inaction. (3\/3)","media":null,"username":"LindseyBoylan","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":true,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":8,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":6,"sumOfClimate":29,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":3.0},{"id":"1301565125523050501","date":1599152282000,"rawContent":"The officers involved must be held accountable, &amp; we must reallocate funding from the police to mental health first responders to start. (3\/3)\n\n#JusticeForDanielPrude #BlackLivesMatter","media":null,"username":"LindseyBoylan","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":9,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":6,"sumOfClimate":29,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":3.0},{"id":"1306640183278866437","date":1600362270000,"rawContent":"Such an important read \u2b07\ufe0f\u2b07\ufe0f #BlackLivesMatter","media":null,"username":"LindseyBoylan","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":10,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":6,"sumOfClimate":29,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":2.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":3.0},{"id":"1310969393413795840","date":1601394434000,"rawContent":"We are facing a climate emergency and yet, it\u2019s not a topic for tonight\u2019s debate. \n\nThe amount of mobilization required to tackle the climate crisis means that our govt\u2014 at every level \u2014 must treat this issue as a top priority, our lives depend on it. #ClimateChange #Debates2020","media":null,"username":"LindseyBoylan","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":true,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":10,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":6,"sumOfClimate":30,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":2.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":1.0},{"id":"1311129129673261056","date":1601432518000,"rawContent":"Supporting Black Lives Matter is acknowledging basic human rights. It should not be talked around but stated plainly and explicitly.  #Debate2020 #BlackLivesMatter","media":null,"username":"LindseyBoylan","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":11,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":6,"sumOfClimate":30,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":3.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":1.0},{"id":"1316336364984717312","date":1602674020000,"rawContent":"This was &amp; is deeply unnerving. She didn\u2019t even rehearse answers on climate change because no one around her gives a shit about it. And they don\u2019t think you do either. \n\nWe have less than a decade to act &amp; far too many people who think like  #AmyConeyBarrett. #ClimateCrisis","media":null,"username":"LindseyBoylan","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":true,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":11,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":6,"sumOfClimate":31,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":2.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":2.0},{"id":"1317937036834332673","date":1603055650000,"rawContent":"Every so often, when in a moment of reflection in this pandemic, I think about how we will have to do all of this &amp; much more to deal with the impending #ClimateCrisis. I think about how ill-equipped we are &amp; how we need a whole new crop of courageous leaders now.  #ClimateAction","media":null,"username":"LindseyBoylan","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":true,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":11,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":6,"sumOfClimate":32,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":3.0},{"id":"1321641911581552640","date":1603938961000,"rawContent":"The Climate Crisis is relentless. And it will hit everyone whether they\u2019re in the path of a particular hurricane or not. #ClimateCrisis","media":null,"username":"LindseyBoylan","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":true,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":11,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":6,"sumOfClimate":33,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":4.0}]